{
    "name": "LCX Liberty DEX",
    "description": "LCX Liberty DEX is a non-custodial DEX aggregator by LCX. It prices every route against its own index of on-chain pools and settles same-chain swaps, and cross-chain swaps that bridge in the same transaction, through one router contract. No protocol fee is taken on the swap.",
    "live": true,
    "categories": [
        "DeFi::DEX Aggregator",
        "DeFi::Cross Chain"
    ],
    "addresses": {
